WEBVTT

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:07.420
What did you choose for your
topic to study over break?

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:09.150
I haven't decided yet.

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:11.500
Hey, do you want to pass through town
on the way home?

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.650
Sounds good.

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:20.420
So...

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:21.040
Huh?

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:22.910
Everybody is going home after today.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:25.540
I'm helping my family with chores
as soon as I get back.

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:27.000
I'm looking after my younger brothers.

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:29.920
Judging from all the people 
carrying bags, I guess so.

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:32.920
All of the upperclassman just graduated, too.

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:35.510
It's going to be a little lonely around here.

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:38.010
Yeah, a bit.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:43.390
I wonder how much time
we have left to spend together.

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:44.420
Huh?

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:51.000
Grea, about this...

00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:53.250
What is this?

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:54.380
Princess.

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:58.540
The valet is awaiting your instructions.
We need to go.

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:00.080
Oh, right.

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:03.290
Sorry. We'll talk about it later.

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:04.040
Okay.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.290
See you later.

00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:14.630
I wonder what it is?

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:24.220
The Pair's Promise

00:01:18.790 --> 00:01:23.710
All right. I'll leave the key to the dorms
in your care during the break, Grea.

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:27.080
Starting tonight the student 
council will also be away.

00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:31.630
If something comes up, please refer it to
the staff in the communications building.

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:34.860
Okay. You haven't been home 
in a while, right, Hanna?

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:36.420
Enjoy the break.

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:37.330
I will.

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:44.420
Anne's going home today, too...

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:47.240
She was complaining earlier about all 
the duties she has to take care of

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:48.960
after she returns to the palace.

00:01:49.110 --> 00:01:50.670
Is that so?

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:53.290
But she'll be back when the
new semester starts, right?

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:55.590
Huh? She hasn't told you yet?

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:56.580
What?

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:57.670
Madam President.

00:01:58.580 --> 00:02:00.500
The wagons have arrived.

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:02.080
Very well.

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:04.880
I'm sorry Grea, but I must be going.

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:07.000
Right. Have a safe trip.

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:09.100
Yes, please enjoy the break yourself.

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:17.380
Anyone traveling east should take
this wagon over here.

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:18.960
Is this the last of the luggage?

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:20.630
Sorry, please take this one too!

00:02:20.630 --> 00:02:23.330
Please make sure to handle 
everything with care.

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:26.620
Students responsible for looking after the animals
over break, please gather over here.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.170
O-oops, sorry about that.

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:29.960
No problem.

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:31.750
This wagon will now depart!

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:34.210
Please wait!

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:45.750
Heave-ho...

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:48.500
Heave-ho... heave-ho...

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:50.040
Do you need any help?

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:52.290
Oh, hey, Grea.

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:54.420
Have you already packed up?

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:57.190
No, I'm staying here over the break.

00:02:57.670 --> 00:03:01.130
Would you mind if I came to visit
your shop at some point?

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:03.080
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:07.460
I'm going to a country out east
to gather new material over the break.

00:03:08.210 --> 00:03:10.080
Then you must be busy.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.460
Yeah, I still need to 
clean up all my supplies.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:14.420
Enjoy the break, Grea.

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:16.580
You too, Ms. Miranda. Safe travels.

00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:21.710
So, nobody is going to be around...

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:29.250
Anyone who is making a return
should line up over here.

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:31.420
Those wanting to check out
should line up on the other side.

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:33.040
Are we going to make the wagon in time?

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:35.080
Could you hurry this up a little, please?

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:36.480
I apologize for the wait.

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:40.630
Guess I'll come back later.

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:14.710
We're closing up soon.

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:17.900
We don't do any checkouts during the break,
so you'd better take

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:19.460
those today if you want them.

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:20.570
Oh, okay.

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:21.790
See you.

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:42.250
Anne...

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:12.710
Anne?

00:05:22.830 --> 00:05:23.830
Anne?

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:25.840
Are you in here?

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:28.630
Huh?

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:44.690
Anne...

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:06.880
Anne.

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:12.000
Dragoness?

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:20.500
Where did you go off to, Grea?

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:23.380
I couldn't find you in the usual spots,
so I had to look around.

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:24.670
Well, I...

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:28.750
Where did you get the idea that we'd
never see each other again? That's crazy.

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:34.620
But... then why was your room empty?

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:38.500
You haven't opened that 
envelope I gave you, yet?

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:39.500
Huh?

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:46.130
Can I open it?

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:47.170
Yeah!

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:56.250
You're applying... to share a room with me?

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:59.670
You were thinking about it 
this morning, weren't you?

00:06:59.670 --> 00:07:00.680
Huh?

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:03.770
"I wonder how much time we have left
to spend together?" you said.

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:09.170
I want to spend a lot of 
time with you too, Grea.

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:13.750
But once we graduate, I don't think we can
stay in the same place anymore.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:22.330
I want to work to make a world where
everyone can live happily.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:26.080
We're both the princesses of
our own countries, after all.

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:31.580
That's why...

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:35.750
I'm asking permission to spend even more
time with you, while we have the chance.

00:07:37.380 --> 00:07:42.790
We'll wake up together, and stay up late
having all sorts of fun talk.

00:07:43.210 --> 00:07:48.230
And if we sleep in and are late for class,
then we'll run there together.

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:54.000
I think... I think we'll enjoy our remaining time
a lot more if we do this.

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:55.830
So that's why...

00:07:57.460 --> 00:07:58.670
Please?

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.420
Don't you think so, too?

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:05.500
Anne...

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:15.250
Am I wrong... Grea?

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:27.150
No.

00:08:30.290 --> 00:08:31.630
You're right.

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:42.170
Okay, I'll send you letters while I'm away.

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:43.290
Right.

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:47.000
Anne.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:48.540
You haven't forgotten anything, right?

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:51.920
Um... if I did, just leave it here.

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:53.910
Okay, will do.

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:57.750
It's way later than I planned. 
Sorry about the mess.

00:08:57.750 --> 00:08:58.790
No problem.

00:08:58.790 --> 00:09:00.560
You should hurry.

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:05.130
All right. See you later, Grea.

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:08.500
Safe travels, Anne.

00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:27.750
If you only eat your favorite foods,
you'll never mature properly!

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:32.580
You have to think about nutritional balance,
and make sure to chew before you swallow!

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:34.090
Yes, ma'am!

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:38.290
I heard Mr. Heinlein is already doing research
presentations even though the year just started.

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:39.880
He's so strict!

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:42.970
But I have to admit, it's kind of refreshing
to have a teacher who is so dedicated.

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:45.460
Well, Ms. Miranda is just 
as super nice as always.

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:48.730
She's the one that waited for you
to turn in your report, right?

00:10:02.420 --> 00:10:04.080
Hello, Grea.

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:07.040
Good morning.

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:14.880
The tea you recommended for last week's tea party
with our new students was a big hit!

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:17.050
Please share your recommendations
with me again sometime.

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:18.920
Oh, that's great news.

00:10:18.920 --> 00:10:22.670
One more thing. Your application
has been accepted and approved.

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:25.680
Thank you.

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:28.510
When the princess comes back from her break,

00:10:28.510 --> 00:10:31.440
please be sure to come to 
the student council office.

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:35.130
We will run down all the important rules
about sharing a room.

00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:36.330
Okay.

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:39.250
Well then, have a nice day, Grea.

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:41.040
Please excuse us.

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:11.100
Grea!

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:22.880
Welcome home, Anne.

00:11:25.420 --> 00:11:31.000
Mysteria Friends

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:46.000
See you again sometime.
Illustration by: Ponzu

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:58.060
Your valiant efforts are 
much appreciated, Owen.

00:11:58.060 --> 00:12:02.080
I, Owen, continue to pledge my life
and honor in your service.

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:05.670
I shall defend you to the utmost of my abilities,
at any and all times.

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:14.040
Okay! That was the last 
of my official duties.

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:16.630
Now I can finally get back to the academy.

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:23.290
But, Princess, His Highness has said that
he wishes to have a quick word with you first.

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:24.710
Again?!

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:28.250
We had a "quick" chat yesterday
that lasted until the sun went down!

00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:31.750
I'm already two weeks 
behind schedule as it is.

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:34.520
If this keeps up, I'll never 
get a chance to leave!

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:36.920
He's just going to give 
me more duties, anyway.

00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:38.750
But that's enough. I'm leaving today.

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:43.080
Princess, His Highness has summoned you.

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:44.670
I can't take this anymore.

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:46.500
I'm counting on you to cover for me.

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:52.580
The princess is still changing her outfit,
so please wait until she's finished.

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:53.790
Thank you.

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:07.290
I think what I can study and experience
at the academy is more important right now.

00:13:07.290 --> 00:13:10.100
I'm going to make that my priority, Father.

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:43.920
It took much longer than usual this time.

00:13:58.330 --> 00:14:00.170
I just love Grea's aroma!

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:08.920
I think... I kept her 
waiting too long, again.

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:12.040
But I'm on my way now, Grea!
